error[E4027]: polymorphic recursion: 'grow' instantiates itself with 'Pair<A, Int>' for 'B'
  --> main.prism:4:63
    4 | fun <A, B> grow(a: A, b: B, n: Int): Int = if (n == 0) 0 else grow(b, Pair(a, 1), n - 1)
      |                                                               ^
   = note: the cycle 'grow' -> 'grow' would need infinitely many instances
   = help: pass the same type arguments on every recursive call, or wrap the value in a non-generic type
